{"asset_key":"ep2/herohub_story_12411360","episode":"ep2","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"12411360","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1241136001:1":{"text":"うわあああああっ！！く、来るなら来い！何が出てきても、ロンロンは怖くないからな！","source_cn":"唔——唔哇啊啊！不管是什么，快出来！满满才不怕你！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x99D2985F77637B84","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1241136002:1":{"text":"驚かさないでよ、ロンロン！一体何を見たって言うの？","source_cn":"满满，你不要吓我！你看到什么了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29A0397A8F7B01E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1241136003:1":{"text":"き、気付いてないの！？さっき、不気味な風が吹いて、恐ろしい叫び声がしただろ？あ、あれは幽霊だよ！もしくは、死海の艦隊がどこかに隠れてるんだ！","source_cn":"你没感受到吗？刚刚有一阵阴冷冷的风，风里有凄厉的叫声—...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x186DA60F12FC4227","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1241136004:1":{"text":"幽霊……？全然気付かなかったけど。","source_cn":"幽灵……？可我完全没看到。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4D4650CF46B6604D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1241136004":{"text":"幽霊……？全然気付かなかったけど。","source_cn":"幽灵……？可我完全没看到。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4D4650CF46B6604D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_t